# Copy to /etc/chart-analyst/secrets.env on the server (or config/secrets.env
# for a local shell). Never commit the copy. Never put a Binance API key here.
# This build does not read trading keys and cannot place or withdraw orders.
#
# Market Bot's webhook. Both are required before a signed POST is attempted.
# The outbox keeps the packet until they are set.
WEBHOOK_URL=
WEBHOOK_SECRET=
# HMAC secret for the review endpoint. If empty, the endpoint falls back to
# WEBHOOK_SECRET. If both are empty the endpoint refuses the request.
REVIEW_SECRET=
# Optional override for the kill-switch file. Creating the file stops new
# paper entries. It does not place or cancel an exchange order.
# KILL_SWITCH_PATH=/var/lib/chart-analyst/KILL
